{
  "name": "arf1_structured_short_repair_20260627",
  "description": "Bounded repair sweep for ARF1 resistance-fade shorts. Tests whether structured short-only resistance fades can become the safer range/pila sleeve after live range wrapper degradation. Research-only; no live unpause.",
